      "handle": "hazel-ashley-checkered",
      "title": "Ashley | Women's Blazer with a Checkered Pattern",
      "collection": "giacche",
      "category": "Ropa",
      "vendor": "Hazel The Label",
      "sourceUrl": "https://hazelthelabel.com/products/ashley-checkered",
      "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Ashley-Checkered-1.webp?v=1764580729",
      "images": [
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Ashley-Checkered-1.webp?v=1764580729",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Ashley-Checkered-2.webp?v=1764580729",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Ashley-Checkered-3.webp?v=1764580729",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Ashley-Checkered-4.webp?v=1764580729"
      ],
      "imageAlt": "Ashley | Women's Blazer with a Checkered Pattern",
      "description": "Make an entrance with the Ashley blazer, a timeless statement piece that blends tailored sophistication with modern feminine structure. Designed with defined shoulders, a cinched waist, and a refined checkered pattern, this blazer sculpts the silhouette while adding a polished, powerful touch to any outfit. Gold-tone buttons and a clean, structured finish elevate the design, making it an essential piece for women who value elegance, confidence, and impeccable style. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for business meetings, office days, networking events, dinner dates, social gatherings, or any occasion where you want to look refined and effortlessly stylish. Pair it with matching shorts for a coordinated set or with jeans for a chic, smart-casual look. MADE FROM: Crafted from high-quality polyester that provides structure, durability, and comfort throughout the day. Composition: 100% Polyester. LENGTH: Classic-length design that follows the natural line of the body, making it easy to style in both professional and elevated everyday outfits. FIT & SIZING: Features a tailored, waist-defining fit with structured shoulders for a sophisticated silhouette. Model is 165 cm tall and wears size S. For the best fit, we recommend sizing up. PROFESSIONAL DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Ashley blazer is more than a wardrobe staple—it’s a symbol of polished elegance and contemporary confidence. With its timeless checkered pattern and flattering shape, it becomes an essential piece for professional settings and special occasions alike.",
