      "imageAlt": "Cynthia | Women's Faux Fur Cropped Hooded Coat",
      "description": "Command attention with the Cynthia faux fur hooded coat, a bold statement outerwear piece designed to elevate your cold-weather wardrobe. Featuring a plush faux fur texture and an oversized hood, this coat delivers dramatic volume with an ultra-luxurious feel. Effortlessly chic and irresistibly cosy, Cynthia transforms everyday winter dressing into a standout look. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for city outings, winter events, après-ski moments, travel days, or elevated everyday wear. Style over knitwear, denim, or tailored separates for an instantly polished cold-season ensemble. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality faux fur with a soft, plush finish that offers warmth, comfort, and a high-end appearance without compromising on wearability. LENGTH: Hip-length design that provides warmth while maintaining a modern, fashion-forward silhouette. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed fit to allow effortless layering. Features a voluminous hood and comfortable sleeves for all-day wear. True to size—refer to the size chart for precise measurements. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Gentle dry clean recommended to maintain the softness, shape, and luxurious texture of the faux fur. The Cynthia hooded coat is more than just outerwear—it’s a confident expression of winter glamour. With its plush texture, dramatic hood, and cosy design, it’s the perfect finishing layer for bold, modern cold-weather styling.",
