      "imageAlt": "Cassidy | Women’s Oversized Faux Fur Jacket",
      "description": "Step into bold sophistication with the Cassidy , a statement outerwear piece designed to elevate any cold-weather look. Featuring a dramatic oversized collar and a relaxed, fashion-forward silhouette, this coat delivers effortless luxury with cozy warmth. The plush faux fur texture adds rich depth and visual impact, making Cassidy the ultimate layering essential for standout style. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for city outings, dinner dates, winter events, weekend getaways, or elevating everyday outfits. Style over dresses, denim, or tailored separates for an instantly chic look. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium faux fur with a soft polyester base, offering warmth, comfort, and a luxe feel without compromising on ease of wear. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit for a relaxed, fashion-forward silhouette. The model is a size 8 and wears a size Small. This coat runs oversized—size down if you prefer a more fitted look. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Gentle dry clean only to maintain the softness and structure of the faux fur. The Cassidy Faux Fur Jacket is more than just outerwear—it’s a statement of confidence and modern luxury. With its bold texture and timeless appeal, it’s the coat you’ll reach for season after season.",
