      "imageAlt": "Alexandra | Women's Belted Double Breasted Long Trench Coat",
      "description": "Complete your wardrobe with the Alexandra trench coat, a timeless outerwear staple designed for effortless sophistication. Featuring a classic double-breasted front, a structured notched lapel collar, shoulder epaulettes, and an adjustable buckle belt, this long trench coat delivers a polished look that transitions seamlessly from workdays to weekends. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for office wear, business meetings, commuting, travel, city outings, weekend brunches, everyday layering, and transitional weather. Style with tailored pants, denim, dresses, or ankle boots for a refined finish. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality woven fabric with a smooth, structured finish, offering lasting comfort and a timeless look for everyday wear. LENGTH: Longline silhouette designed to provide elegant coverage while creating a streamlined, tailored appearance. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed tailored fit, featuring a double-breasted button closure, adjustable waist belt with buckle, shoulder epaulettes, cuff tabs, and functional side pockets for versatile everyday styling. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Alexandra Trench Coat is a timeless wardrobe essential that blends classic tailoring with everyday versatility. Its elegant longline design and refined details make it an effortless layering piece for work, travel, and season-to-season styling.",
