      "imageAlt": "Brenda | Women's Drawstring Waist High Neck Utility Jacket",
      "description": "Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Brenda utility jacket, a versatile layering piece designed for effortless style and functionality. Featuring a high stand collar, adjustable drawstring waist, oversized long sleeves, and a zip front with snap-button closure, this lightweight jacket offers a relaxed silhouette that's easy to dress up or down throughout the seasons. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday wear, travel, city outings, weekend adventures, casual errands, outdoor activities, and transitional weather. Pair with jeans, leggings, cargo pants, or sneakers for an effortlessly modern look. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality lightweight woven fabric with a smooth finish, providing comfortable coverage for layering during changing seasons. LENGTH: Hip-length design with a relaxed silhouette that offers comfortable coverage while maintaining a clean, casual look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed fit, featuring an adjustable drawstring waist for customizable shaping, oversized long sleeves, flap pockets, and a zip and snap-button front closure for versatile everyday wear. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Brenda Utility Jacket combines practical design with timeless style, making it an essential layering piece for everyday outfits, travel, and seasonal dressing. Its versatile silhouette pairs effortlessly with both casual and elevated looks.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Refresh your everyday wardrobe with the Brenda utility jacket, a versatile layering piece designed for effortless style and functionality. Featuring a high stand collar, adjustable drawstring waist, oversized long sleeves, and a zip front with snap-button closure, this lightweight jacket offers a relaxed silhouette that's easy to dress up or down throughout the seasons. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday wear, travel, city outings, weekend adventures, casual errands, outdoor activities, and transitional weather. Pair with jeans, leggings, cargo pants, or sneakers for an effortlessly modern look. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality lightweight woven fabric with a smooth finish, providing comfortable coverage for layering during changing seasons. LENGTH: Hip-length design with a relaxed silhouette that offers comfortable coverage while maintaining a clean, casual look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed fit, featuring an adjustable drawstring waist for customizable shaping, oversized long sleeves, flap pockets, and a zip and snap-button front closure for versatile everyday wear. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Brenda Utility Jacket combines practical design with timeless style, making it an essential layering piece for everyday outfits, travel, and seasonal dressing. Its versatile silhouette pairs effortlessly with both casual and elevated looks.</p>",
