      "imageAlt": "Deborah | Women's Belted Shawl Collar Faux Suede Trench Coat Jacket",
      "description": "Refine your everyday wardrobe with the Deborah faux suede jacket, an elegant layering piece designed with timeless sophistication. Featuring a soft shawl collar, a single-button front closure, a self-tie waist belt, and a tailored peplum silhouette, this jacket offers a polished look that transitions effortlessly from work to weekend. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for office wear, business meetings, travel, city outings, dinner dates, everyday layering, and transitional weather. Style with tailored pants, skirts, dresses, or denim for a refined and versatile outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality faux suede fabric with a soft, smooth texture, offering comfortable wear and an elegant finish for everyday styling. LENGTH: Hip-length design with a tailored peplum silhouette that creates a polished and flattering look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a tailored fit, featuring a shawl collar, single-button front closure, adjustable self-tie waist belt, long sleeves, and a peplum hem that enhances the silhouette while allowing comfortable layering. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Deborah Faux Suede Jacket combines timeless tailoring with soft texture, making it a versatile wardrobe essential for workdays, travel, and everyday occasions. Its elegant silhouette pairs effortlessly with both casual and dressier ensembles.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Refine your everyday wardrobe with the Deborah faux suede jacket, an elegant layering piece designed with timeless sophistication. Featuring a soft shawl collar, a single-button front closure, a self-tie waist belt, and a tailored peplum silhouette, this jacket offers a polished look that transitions effortlessly from work to weekend. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for office wear, business meetings, travel, city outings, dinner dates, everyday layering, and transitional weather. Style with tailored pants, skirts, dresses, or denim for a refined and versatile outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality faux suede fabric with a soft, smooth texture, offering comfortable wear and an elegant finish for everyday styling. LENGTH: Hip-length design with a tailored peplum silhouette that creates a polished and flattering look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a tailored fit, featuring a shawl collar, single-button front closure, adjustable self-tie waist belt, long sleeves, and a peplum hem that enhances the silhouette while allowing comfortable layering. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Deborah Faux Suede Jacket combines timeless tailoring with soft texture, making it a versatile wardrobe essential for workdays, travel, and everyday occasions. Its elegant silhouette pairs effortlessly with both casual and dressier ensembles.</p>",
