      "imageAlt": "Esther | Women's Drawstring Waist Hooded Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay comfortable through cooler days with the Esther puffer jacket, a versatile outerwear essential designed for everyday wear. Featuring a quilted construction, a high stand collar with an attached hood, an adjustable drawstring waist, and a zip front with snap-button closure, this jacket combines classic styling with practical everyday functionality. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for commuting, travel, outdoor activities, casual outings, weekend errands, everyday wear, and cold-weather layering. Pair with jeans, leggings, sweaters, and boots for a comfortable seasonal look. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality quilted woven fabric with lightweight insulation, offering comfortable warmth and durable everyday wear during cooler seasons. LENGTH: Hip-length design with a relaxed silhouette that provides comfortable coverage while maintaining a clean and modern appearance. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed fit, featuring a high stand collar with an attached hood, adjustable drawstring waist, long sleeves with elastic cuffs, side pockets, and a zip and snap-button front closure for versatile layering. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Esther Puffer Jacket blends everyday practicality with timeless style, making it an essential layering piece for commuting, travel, and seasonal outings. Its versatile design pairs effortlessly with casual wardrobes throughout the colder months.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Stay comfortable through cooler days with the Esther puffer jacket, a versatile outerwear essential designed for everyday wear. Featuring a quilted construction, a high stand collar with an attached hood, an adjustable drawstring waist, and a zip front with snap-button closure, this jacket combines classic styling with practical everyday functionality. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for commuting, travel, outdoor activities, casual outings, weekend errands, everyday wear, and cold-weather layering. Pair with jeans, leggings, sweaters, and boots for a comfortable seasonal look. MADE FROM: Crafted from premium-quality quilted woven fabric with lightweight insulation, offering comfortable warmth and durable everyday wear during cooler seasons. LENGTH: Hip-length design with a relaxed silhouette that provides comfortable coverage while maintaining a clean and modern appearance. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed fit, featuring a high stand collar with an attached hood, adjustable drawstring waist, long sleeves with elastic cuffs, side pockets, and a zip and snap-button front closure for versatile layering. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Esther Puffer Jacket blends everyday practicality with timeless style, making it an essential layering piece for commuting, travel, and seasonal outings. Its versatile design pairs effortlessly with casual wardrobes throughout the colder months.</p>",
