      "imageAlt": "Patricia | Women's Oversized Notch Lapel Wool Blend Jacket",
      "description": "Elevate everyday layering with the Patricia jacket, a tailored wardrobe staple designed with a relaxed, modern silhouette. Featuring oversized notch lapels, dropped shoulders, long sleeves, and a single-breasted button closure, this jacket brings polished structure to workwear and casual outfits. Front welt pockets add a practical detail, while the hip-length cut makes it easy to style throughout the cooler seasons. WHERE TO WEAR: Ideal for office days, business-casual settings, city outings, travel, brunch, and everyday fall or winter wear. Layer it over a blouse and tailored pants for work, or pair it with a knit top and jeans for a relaxed look. MADE FROM: Crafted from a wool-blend fabric with a structured feel, designed for comfortable layering during cooler weather. LENGTH : Hip-length silhouette that provides versatile coverage and pairs easily with dresses, skirts, jeans, and tailored pants. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed oversized fit, dropped shoulders, and roomy long sleeves. Select your usual size for the intended oversized look, or size down for a more tailored fit. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Patricia jacket combines classic tailoring with a contemporary oversized shape. Its structured lapels, practical pockets, and easy-to-layer design make it a versatile choice for polished everyday styling.",
