      "imageAlt": "Aubri | Women's Hooded Faux Fur Zip Up Knit Cardigan Jacket",
      "description": "Stay warm and stylish with the Aubri cardigan jacket, a cozy heavyweight knit layer designed for cold-weather comfort. Featuring a full front zipper closure, an oversized hood with plush faux fur trim, long sleeves, and ribbed cuffs and hem, this jacket combines a relaxed silhouette with soft, practical details. WHERE TO WEAR: Ideal for casual outings, weekend plans, travel, lounging, outdoor walks, errands, and everyday cold-weather wear. Pair it with jeans and boots for a cozy seasonal outfit, or style it with leggings and sneakers for a comfortable travel look. MADE FROM: Crafted from soft heavyweight knit fabric with plush faux fur trim around the hood for added warmth and texture. LENGTH : Designed with a comfortable hip-length silhouette that pairs easily with jeans, leggings, pants, and casual dresses. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed fit, roomy hood, long sleeves, and space for comfortable layering. Select your usual size for the intended relaxed fit, or size down for a closer silhouette. GENTLE HAND WASH COLD. The Aubri cardigan jacket combines the comfort of a soft knit cardigan with the warmth and coverage of a hooded jacket. Its plush faux fur trim, practical zip-front design, and cozy construction make it a versatile layer for travel, outdoor walks, lounging, and everyday winter styling.",
