      "imageAlt": "Reagan | Women's Oversized Faux Leather Biker Jacket",
      "description": "Add a bold finishing layer to everyday outfits with the Reagan jacket, an oversized biker-inspired style designed with a relaxed cropped silhouette. Featuring a high stand collar with snap-button closure, concealed front zipper fastening, dropped shoulders, long sleeves, and elasticized cuffs and hem, this jacket delivers a clean, modern take on classic moto styling. WHERE TO WEAR : Ideal for casual outings, city days, travel, weekend plans, concerts, streetwear looks, and cool-weather layering. Pair it with jeans and boots for an edgy everyday outfit, or layer it over a fitted dress for a balanced, modern look. MADE FROM : Crafted from smooth faux leather with a comfortable lining and structured finish suitable for seasonal layering. LENGTH : Cropped silhouette designed to sit near the waist and pair easily with high-rise jeans, pants, skirts, and dresses. FIT & SIZING : Designed with a relaxed oversized fit, dropped shoulders, and elasticized cuffs and hem. Select your usual size for the intended loose fit, or size down for a more fitted silhouette. GENTLE WIPE CLEAN ONLY . The Reagan jacket combines classic biker-inspired details with a streamlined concealed closure and modern oversized shape. Its smooth faux leather finish, practical side pockets, and cropped silhouette make it a versatile statement layer for city outings, travel, concerts, and casual everyday styling.",
