      "imageAlt": "Chelsea | Women's Faux Fur Animal Print Coat",
      "description": "Make a bold entrance in the Chelsea coat, a statement-making outerwear piece designed with a plush faux fur finish and an eye-catching animal-inspired print. The high stand collar adds polished structure, while the relaxed oversized silhouette creates an effortlessly glamorous look. Finished with long sleeves, a smooth lining, and concealed hook-and-eye closures, it brings warmth, comfort, and standout style to every cold-weather outfit. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for holiday parties, evening events, dinner dates, city outings, winter vacations, special occasions, or elevated everyday styling. Layer it over a fitted dress, tailored separates, or denim for a confident cold-weather look. MADE FROM: Crafted from soft faux fur with a plush textured finish and smooth inner lining for added comfort and easy layering. LENGTH: Designed with a versatile mid-length silhouette that provides comfortable coverage while maintaining a stylish, balanced shape. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed oversized fit for comfortable layering. Select your usual size for the intended loose silhouette, or size down for a more fitted appearance. GENTLE DRY CLEAN ONLY. The Chelsea Coat is more than a winter layer—it is a bold expression of confidence and modern glamour. With its plush texture, striking animal print, and effortless oversized fit, it is a statement piece you will reach for throughout the colder seasons.",
