      "imageAlt": "Ariane | Women's High Collar Long Sleeve Hooded Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay cozy without sacrificing style in the Ariane puffer jacket, a modern cold-weather layer designed for effortless everyday wear. Featuring a protective high collar, attached hood, long sleeves, and a relaxed silhouette, this jacket delivers comfortable coverage with a clean, contemporary finish. Its versatile design makes it easy to layer over everything from casual basics to cozy winter knits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday commutes, city outings, weekend trips, travel, shopping days, or casual cold-weather plans. Layer over a fitted turtleneck with straight-leg jeans and sneakers for an effortless daytime look, or pair with leggings and boots for cozy weekend style. MADE FROM: Crafted from polyester with insulating padding designed to provide comfortable warmth during cooler weather. The outer material offers practical coverage while maintaining a lightweight, easy-to-layer feel. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a high collar, protective hood, long sleeves, front zipper closure, and roomy side pockets for everyday essentials. The relaxed silhouette provides space for layering while maintaining a modern, streamlined look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed, oversized-inspired fit that layers comfortably over sweaters and everyday basics. Available in US sizes S–L. We recommend choosing your usual size for a relaxed look and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. CARE: Gently wipe away light surface marks with a soft, dry cloth. For more noticeable spots, use a slightly damp cloth and allow the jacket to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Always follow the garment care label for complete care instructions. The Ariane Puffer Jacket combines cozy insulation, practical coverage, and an effortlessly modern silhouette for a versatile cold-weather essential. Available in Black, Navy, Light Gray, and Army Green, it’s an easy layer for everything from weekday commutes to relaxed winter weekends.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Stay cozy without sacrificing style in the Ariane puffer jacket, a modern cold-weather layer designed for effortless everyday wear. Featuring a protective high collar, attached hood, long sleeves, and a relaxed silhouette, this jacket delivers comfortable coverage with a clean, contemporary finish. Its versatile design makes it easy to layer over everything from casual basics to cozy winter knits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday commutes, city outings, weekend trips, travel, shopping days, or casual cold-weather plans. Layer over a fitted turtleneck with straight-leg jeans and sneakers for an effortless daytime look, or pair with leggings and boots for cozy weekend style. MADE FROM: Crafted from polyester with insulating padding designed to provide comfortable warmth during cooler weather. The outer material offers practical coverage while maintaining a lightweight, easy-to-layer feel. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a high collar, protective hood, long sleeves, front zipper closure, and roomy side pockets for everyday essentials. The relaxed silhouette provides space for layering while maintaining a modern, streamlined look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a relaxed, oversized-inspired fit that layers comfortably over sweaters and everyday basics. Available in US sizes S–L. We recommend choosing your usual size for a relaxed look and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. CARE: Gently wipe away light surface marks with a soft, dry cloth. For more noticeable spots, use a slightly damp cloth and allow the jacket to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Always follow the garment care label for complete care instructions. The Ariane Puffer Jacket combines cozy insulation, practical coverage, and an effortlessly modern silhouette for a versatile cold-weather essential. Available in Black, Navy, Light Gray, and Army Green, it’s an easy layer for everything from weekday commutes to relaxed winter weekends.</p>",
