      "imageAlt": "Hilary | Women's Hooded Zip Front Long Sleeve Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay comfortably layered with the Hilary puffer jacket, a versatile hybrid style that combines cozy quilted padding with the flexibility of soft jersey. Featuring a padded front body, attached drawstring hood, and long jersey sleeves, this jacket delivers lightweight warmth with a sporty, streamlined silhouette. The full zip front makes it an effortless layer for everyday wear and changing temperatures. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, travel, morning walks, weekend plans, or transitional weather. Pair with jeans and sneakers for a relaxed daytime look, or style with leggings and a lightweight sweater for an easy athleisure-inspired outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded front panel for added warmth and soft jersey fabric through the sleeves and side panels for comfortable movement and easy layering. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood with adjustable drawstrings, full front zipper closure, quilted padded body, and long jersey sleeves. The mixed-material construction creates a modern contrast while maintaining a clean, casual finish. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable everyday fit that allows room for light layering underneath. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a more relaxed fit or plan to wear heavier layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. When needed, gently spot clean and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat to help preserve the quilted padding and soft jersey panels. The Hilary Puffer Jacket brings together quilted warmth and soft jersey comfort in a lightweight hybrid design. Easy to layer and effortless to style, it’s a versatile choice for casual days, travel, and transitional weather.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Stay comfortably layered with the Hilary puffer jacket, a versatile hybrid style that combines cozy quilted padding with the flexibility of soft jersey. Featuring a padded front body, attached drawstring hood, and long jersey sleeves, this jacket delivers lightweight warmth with a sporty, streamlined silhouette. The full zip front makes it an effortless layer for everyday wear and changing temperatures. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday errands, casual outings, travel, morning walks, weekend plans, or transitional weather. Pair with jeans and sneakers for a relaxed daytime look, or style with leggings and a lightweight sweater for an easy athleisure-inspired outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded front panel for added warmth and soft jersey fabric through the sleeves and side panels for comfortable movement and easy layering. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood with adjustable drawstrings, full front zipper closure, quilted padded body, and long jersey sleeves. The mixed-material construction creates a modern contrast while maintaining a clean, casual finish. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable everyday fit that allows room for light layering underneath. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a more relaxed fit or plan to wear heavier layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. When needed, gently spot clean and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat to help preserve the quilted padding and soft jersey panels. The Hilary Puffer Jacket brings together quilted warmth and soft jersey comfort in a lightweight hybrid design. Easy to layer and effortless to style, it’s a versatile choice for casual days, travel, and transitional weather.</p>",
