      "id": 122,
      "handle": "hazel-marcy",
      "title": "Marcy | Women's Zip Front Ribbed Cuffs Cropped Puffer Jacket",
      "collection": "giacche",
      "category": "Ropa",
      "vendor": "Hazel The Label",
      "sourceUrl": "https://hazelthelabel.com/products/marcy",
      "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-1.png?v=1790001935",
      "images": [
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-1.png?v=1790001935",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-2.png?v=1790001946",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-3.png?v=1790001956",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-4.png?v=1790001965",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-5.png?v=1790001974",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-6.png?v=1790001985",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-7.png?v=1790001994",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-8.jpg?v=1790002001",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-9.webp?v=1790002008",
        "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/5972/8983/files/HazelTheLabel-Marcy-09.webp?v=1789941977"
      ],
      "imageAlt": "Marcy | Women's Zip Front Ribbed Cuffs Cropped Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Refresh your cold-weather wardrobe with the Marcy puffer jacket, a modern cropped layer designed with bold volume and effortless everyday appeal. Featuring an oversized silhouette, wide dropped shoulders, and a fully padded body, this jacket creates a relaxed statement look while keeping seasonal styling easy. The stand-up collar and ribbed cuffs add a polished finish to its contemporary shape. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, shopping days, weekend plans, travel, city walks, or everyday cold-weather wear. Pair with high-waisted jeans and sneakers for an effortless street-style look, or style with leggings, a fitted sweater, and ankle boots for a balanced seasonal outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a smooth outer shell and padded construction for a soft, voluminous finish and comfortable warmth during cooler weather. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a stand-up collar, full front zipper, wide dropped shoulders, and long sleeves finished with ribbed cuffs for a softly gathered effect. The cropped length balances the oversized proportions for a modern, fashion-forward silhouette. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit through the body and shoulders, finishing around the hip. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended relaxed silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. For a closer fit, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the outer fabric and padded construction. The Marcy Puffer Jacket combines statement volume, a cropped silhouette, and cozy padded construction for an effortlessly modern cold-weather layer. From casual denim to sporty everyday looks, it’s an easy way to bring contemporary style to your fall and winter wardrobe.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Refresh your cold-weather wardrobe with the Marcy puffer jacket, a modern cropped layer designed with bold volume and effortless everyday appeal. Featuring an oversized silhouette, wide dropped shoulders, and a fully padded body, this jacket creates a relaxed statement look while keeping seasonal styling easy. The stand-up collar and ribbed cuffs add a polished finish to its contemporary shape. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, shopping days, weekend plans, travel, city walks, or everyday cold-weather wear. Pair with high-waisted jeans and sneakers for an effortless street-style look, or style with leggings, a fitted sweater, and ankle boots for a balanced seasonal outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a smooth outer shell and padded construction for a soft, voluminous finish and comfortable warmth during cooler weather. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a stand-up collar, full front zipper, wide dropped shoulders, and long sleeves finished with ribbed cuffs for a softly gathered effect. The cropped length balances the oversized proportions for a modern, fashion-forward silhouette. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit through the body and shoulders, finishing around the hip. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended relaxed silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. For a closer fit, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the outer fabric and padded construction. The Marcy Puffer Jacket combines statement volume, a cropped silhouette, and cozy padded construction for an effortlessly modern cold-weather layer. From casual denim to sporty everyday looks, it’s an easy way to bring contemporary style to your fall and winter wardrobe.</p>",
