      "description": "Stay comfortably covered through colder days with the Shaina puffer coat, a longline outerwear essential designed for cozy warmth and effortless everyday style. Featuring an attached hood, soft faux-fur lining, and padded construction, this coat offers extended coverage while maintaining a clean, streamlined silhouette. Its versatile design makes it an easy layer over sweaters, knits, and everyday winter outfits. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for winter commutes, everyday errands, weekend outings, travel, city walks, or casual cold-weather plans. Layer over a chunky sweater with jeans and boots for a classic winter look, or pair with leggings and cozy knits for relaxed everyday dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a padded outer shell and soft faux-fur lining for added warmth and a cozy feel during colder weather. The longline construction provides extended coverage through the body and legs. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and a streamlined longline silhouette. The faux-fur lining adds softness and warmth, while the padded construction creates a classic cold-weather puffer look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a structured yet comfortable fit that allows room for layering over sweaters and seasonal knits. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer additional room for heavier layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the padded construction and faux-fur lining. The Shaina Puffer Coat combines extended coverage, cozy faux-fur softness, and a clean longline silhouette for an effortlessly versatile winter layer. From weekday commutes to weekend outings, it’s an easy cold-weather staple designed to complement your seasonal wardrobe.",
