      "imageAlt": "Tallie | Women's Quilted Longline Hooded Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay polished through cooler days with the Tallie puffer jacket, a sophisticated longline layer designed to combine cozy coverage with effortless everyday style. Featuring distinctive diamond quilting, an attached hood, and an elongated silhouette, this jacket offers a refined take on classic cold-weather outerwear. Its streamlined shape makes it easy to layer over everything from casual knits to dresses and tailored separates. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for everyday commutes, weekend outings, travel, shopping days, city walks, or transitional and winter weather. Layer over a sweater with jeans and ankle boots for a polished daytime look, or style over a knit dress with tall boots for an elevated seasonal outfit. MADE FROM: Crafted with a padded outer construction featuring diamond quilting for added texture and a softly structured finish. The lightweight layered design provides comfortable coverage while remaining easy to wear over seasonal essentials. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood, long sleeves, diamond-quilted detailing, and a streamlined longline silhouette. The extended length provides additional coverage while the geometric quilting gives the classic puffer style a polished, contemporary finish. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable, easy-to-layer fit that works over sweaters, dresses, and everyday basics. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer additional room for heavier layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the quilted construction and overall shape. The Tallie Puffer Jacket combines elegant diamond quilting, a practical hood, and extended longline coverage for a refined cold-weather essential. From weekday commutes to weekend travel, it’s a versatile layer that brings polished style to your fall and winter wardrobe.",
