      "imageAlt": "Christa | Women's Drawstring Waist Zip Front Long Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Stay comfortably covered through colder days with the Christa puffer jacket, a longline outerwear essential designed to combine cozy warmth with a flattering, adjustable silhouette. Featuring a faux fur-trimmed hood, full zip front, and drawstring waist, this jacket offers extended coverage while allowing you to customize the shape. Its clean, streamlined design makes it an effortless layer for everything from weekday commutes to relaxed winter weekends. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for winter commutes, everyday errands, weekend outings, travel, city walks, or casual cold-weather plans. Layer over a chunky sweater with jeans and boots for a classic winter look, or pair with leggings and cozy knits for relaxed everyday styling. MADE FROM: Crafted with a padded outer construction for comfortable cold-weather coverage, complemented by soft faux-fur trim around the hood for added texture and a cozy seasonal finish. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a faux fur-trimmed hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist for personalized shaping. The longline silhouette provides extended coverage, while finished cuffs and hems create a clean, structured look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable, layer-friendly fit and an adjustable drawstring waist that can be cinched for added definition. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you plan to layer over heavier sweaters, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the padded construction and faux-fur trim. The Christa Puffer Jacket combines longline coverage, cozy faux-fur detailing, and an adjustable waist for an effortlessly polished cold-weather look. From daily com",
