      "description": "Make a bold entrance in the Leora puffer jacket, a statement cold-weather layer that combines classic quilted comfort with eye-catching leopard print. Featuring an attached hood, full zip front, and long sleeves, this jacket brings personality to everyday fall and winter outfits while maintaining a clean, structured silhouette. The regular fit makes it easy to layer over your favorite tees, sweaters, and seasonal basics. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, shopping days, weekend plans, travel, city walks, or everyday fall and winter wear. Pair with black jeans and ankle boots for a polished statement look, or style with leggings, a simple tee, and sneakers for effortless off-duty dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded construction for comfortable seasonal coverage and a softly structured feel. The allover leopard print adds a bold finish while keeping the silhouette versatile for everyday styling. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with an attached hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and practical side pockets for small essentials or warming your hands. The streamlined quilted construction adds dimension without overwhelming the silhouette. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a regular, comfortable fit that allows room for layering over tees, knits, and lightweight sweaters. We recommend choosing your usual US size and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a roomier silhouette or plan to wear heavier layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the quilted construction and printed finish. The Leora Puffer Jacket combines statement leopard print with an easy-to-layer quilted silhouette for a fresh take on everyday cold-weather style. Available in Brown and Burgundy, it’s a standout seasonal layer that brings effortless personality to your fall and winter wardrobe.",
