      "imageAlt": "Perla | Women's Oversized Collar Tie Belt Long Sleeve Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Wrap up in polished comfort with the Perla puffer jacket, a sophisticated oversized layer designed with statement proportions and a flattering belted finish. Featuring a wide portrait collar, dropped shoulders, and broad horizontal quilting, this jacket creates a softly structured silhouette with an elevated feel. The self-tie waist belt lets you define your shape while maintaining the relaxed appeal of the oversized design. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for brunch dates, city outings, weekend plans, dinner dates, shopping days, or elevated everyday wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for a polished daytime look, or style over a fitted knit dress with tall boots for sophisticated cold-weather dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a padded construction arranged in broad horizontal quilted panels for comfortable coverage and a softly structured finish. The ribbed self-tie belt adds subtle texture while creating adjustable definition at the waist. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a wide fold-over portrait collar, dropped shoulders, wrap front, concealed snap fastening, and long sleeves. A ribbed self-tie belt cinches the waist, while the hip-length cut balances the jacket’s relaxed, voluminous proportions. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit through the body and shoulders, with an adjustable belt for personalized shaping at the waist. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended relaxed silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. For a closer fit, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the padded construction, quilting, and overall shape. The Perla Puffer Jacket combines statement quilting, an elegant portrait collar, and a waist-defining tie belt for a refined take on cold-weather layering. From polished daytime outfits to elevated evenings, it’s a versatile piece that brings effortless sophistication to your seasonal wardrobe.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Wrap up in polished comfort with the Perla puffer jacket, a sophisticated oversized layer designed with statement proportions and a flattering belted finish. Featuring a wide portrait collar, dropped shoulders, and broad horizontal quilting, this jacket creates a softly structured silhouette with an elevated feel. The self-tie waist belt lets you define your shape while maintaining the relaxed appeal of the oversized design. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for brunch dates, city outings, weekend plans, dinner dates, shopping days, or elevated everyday wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for a polished daytime look, or style over a fitted knit dress with tall boots for sophisticated cold-weather dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted with a padded construction arranged in broad horizontal quilted panels for comfortable coverage and a softly structured finish. The ribbed self-tie belt adds subtle texture while creating adjustable definition at the waist. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a wide fold-over portrait collar, dropped shoulders, wrap front, concealed snap fastening, and long sleeves. A ribbed self-tie belt cinches the waist, while the hip-length cut balances the jacket’s relaxed, voluminous proportions. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit through the body and shoulders, with an adjustable belt for personalized shaping at the waist. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended relaxed silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. For a closer fit, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products to help preserve the padded construction, quilting, and overall shape. The Perla Puffer Jacket combines statement quilting, an elegant portrait collar, and a waist-defining tie belt for a refined take on cold-weather layering. From polished daytime outfits to elevated evenings, it’s a versatile piece that brings effortless sophistication to your seasonal wardrobe.</p>",
