      "imageAlt": "Arwen | Women's Hooded Drawstring Front Long Quilted Puffer Jacket",
      "description": "Take on colder days in effortless style with the Arwen puffer jacket, a longline winter essential designed for cozy coverage and a flattering silhouette. Featuring a quilted padded body, plush faux fur-trimmed hood, and adjustable drawstring waist, this jacket balances practical cold-weather layering with a polished feminine shape. The full zip front and below-the-knee length make it an easy choice for everyday winter dressing. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for winter commutes, weekend outings, travel, city walks, shopping days, or everyday errands. Style with a cozy sweater, jeans, and tall boots for a classic cold-weather look, or pair with leggings and ankle boots for comfortable everyday wear. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded construction for comfortable seasonal warmth and a softly structured finish. The hood is accented with plush faux-fur trim, adding cozy texture and an elevated winter-inspired touch. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a faux fur-trimmed hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist that allows you to customize the silhouette. The long quilted body extends below the knee for additional coverage while maintaining a streamlined look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable, layering-friendly fit and an adjustable waist for personalized shaping. Choose your usual US size for the intended fit and refer to the size chart for the most accurate measurements. If you prefer extra room for heavier sweaters and winter layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Handle the faux-fur trim gently and avoid harsh cleaning products to help maintain the jacket’s quilting, padding, and overall appearance. The Arwen Puffer Jacket brings together extended below-the-knee coverage, classic quilting, a cozy faux fur-trimmed hood, and an adjustable drawstring waist. Versatile enough for everyday commutes, weekend plans, and winter travel, it’s a polished cold-weather layer you’ll reach for throughout the season.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Take on colder days in effortless style with the Arwen puffer jacket, a longline winter essential designed for cozy coverage and a flattering silhouette. Featuring a quilted padded body, plush faux fur-trimmed hood, and adjustable drawstring waist, this jacket balances practical cold-weather layering with a polished feminine shape. The full zip front and below-the-knee length make it an easy choice for everyday winter dressing. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for winter commutes, weekend outings, travel, city walks, shopping days, or everyday errands. Style with a cozy sweater, jeans, and tall boots for a classic cold-weather look, or pair with leggings and ankle boots for comfortable everyday wear. MADE FROM: Crafted with a quilted padded construction for comfortable seasonal warmth and a softly structured finish. The hood is accented with plush faux-fur trim, adding cozy texture and an elevated winter-inspired touch. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a faux fur-trimmed hood, full front zipper, long sleeves, and an adjustable drawstring waist that allows you to customize the silhouette. The long quilted body extends below the knee for additional coverage while maintaining a streamlined look. FIT & SIZING: Designed with a comfortable, layering-friendly fit and an adjustable waist for personalized shaping. Choose your usual US size for the intended fit and refer to the size chart for the most accurate measurements. If you prefer extra room for heavier sweaters and winter layers, consider sizing up. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Handle the faux-fur trim gently and avoid harsh cleaning products to help maintain the jacket’s quilting, padding, and overall appearance. The Arwen Puffer Jacket brings together extended below-the-knee coverage, classic quilting, a cozy faux fur-trimmed hood, and an adjustable drawstring waist. Versatile enough for everyday commutes, weekend plans, and winter travel, it’s a polished cold-weather layer you’ll reach for throughout the season.</p>",
