      "imageAlt": "Natasha | Women's High Collar Zip Front Long Sleeve Patch Pockets Teddy Jacket",
      "description": "Wrap yourself in cozy texture with the Natasha teddy jacket, an effortlessly stylish cold-weather layer designed with a soft, oversized silhouette. Featuring a dense looped borg pile, high stand collar, and smooth woven trim, this jacket brings warmth and texture to everyday outfits. The two-way front zipper and roomy patch pockets add practical finishing touches to its relaxed, modern design. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, weekend errands, coffee dates, travel, shopping days, or everyday cold-weather wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an easy polished look, or style with leggings, a fitted knit, and sneakers for relaxed weekend dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted from dense looped borg teddy pile for a plush, textured feel. Smooth woven trim along the collar, front placket, and pocket edges creates subtle contrast and gives the jacket a clean, structured finish. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a high stand collar, dropped shoulders, long full sleeves, and a two-way front zipper for versatile styling. Two generously sized patch pockets sit at the front hips, while the hip-length cut balances the jacket’s cozy oversized proportions. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit through the body and shoulders for comfortable layering. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended relaxed silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a closer, less oversized look, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products and excessive friction to help maintain the soft texture and appearance of the teddy pile. The Natasha Teddy Jacket combines plush borg texture, an oversized silhouette, and practical patch pockets for an effortlessly cozy seasonal layer. Finished with a high collar and two-way zipper, it’s an easy choice for casual days, weekend plans, and comfortable cold-weather styling.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy texture with the Natasha teddy jacket, an effortlessly stylish cold-weather layer designed with a soft, oversized silhouette. Featuring a dense looped borg pile, high stand collar, and smooth woven trim, this jacket brings warmth and texture to everyday outfits. The two-way front zipper and roomy patch pockets add practical finishing touches to its relaxed, modern design. WHERE TO WEAR: Perfect for casual outings, weekend errands, coffee dates, travel, shopping days, or everyday cold-weather wear. Pair with straight-leg jeans and ankle boots for an easy polished look, or style with leggings, a fitted knit, and sneakers for relaxed weekend dressing. MADE FROM: Crafted from dense looped borg teddy pile for a plush, textured feel. Smooth woven trim along the collar, front placket, and pocket edges creates subtle contrast and gives the jacket a clean, structured finish. DESIGN & DETAILS: Designed with a high stand collar, dropped shoulders, long full sleeves, and a two-way front zipper for versatile styling. Two generously sized patch pockets sit at the front hips, while the hip-length cut balances the jacket’s cozy oversized proportions. FIT & SIZING: Designed with an intentionally oversized fit through the body and shoulders for comfortable layering. We recommend choosing your usual US size for the intended relaxed silhouette and referring to the size chart for the most accurate fit. If you prefer a closer, less oversized look, consider sizing down. CARE: Follow the garment care label for the best results. Gently spot clean when needed and allow to air dry naturally away from direct heat. Avoid harsh cleaning products and excessive friction to help maintain the soft texture and appearance of the teddy pile. The Natasha Teddy Jacket combines plush borg texture, an oversized silhouette, and practical patch pockets for an effortlessly cozy seasonal layer. Finished with a high collar and two-way zipper, it’s an easy choice for casual days, weekend plans, and comfortable cold-weather styling.</p>",
