      "description": "Introducing the ‘Giulia Mini’ – a playful blend of vintage charm and modern femininity. Designed in a timeless black polka dot print, this flirty mini dress features a flattering square halter neckline that beautifully frames the shoulders and décolletage. The structured bodice is shaped with princess seams to enhance the silhouette, while the shirred back panel and lace-up detail create a perfectly cinched, adjustable fit at the waist. Flowing from the hips, the voluminous puffball skirt adds a fun, statement-making finish that feels both romantic and fashion-forward. Chic, feminine and effortlessly eye-catching, the Giulia Mini is made for moments that call for confidence and playful elegance. WHERE TO WEAR: Brunch dates, garden parties, summer events, vacations, birthday celebrations, girls’ nights out, and stylish daytime occasions. UNDERWEAR SOLUTION: Seamless underwear or strapless bra recommended. Stretch Factor: 1/3 Model: 1.73m (5'8\") wearing size XS.",
