      "imageAlt": "Chiara",
      "description": "Introducing the ‘Chiara Mini’ – a delicate expression of soft femininity and effortless movement. Crafted in an airy baby-blue chiffon, this dress features an elegant halter neckline with thick neck straps that frame the shoulders beautifully, while the open back adds a touch of modern allure. Cut on the bias for a fluid drape, the silhouette skims the body softly before flowing into a tiered asymmetrical flare skirt with a subtly tilted hemline that moves beautifully with every step. The pleated waistband and asymmetrical waistline enhance the shape while keeping the bodice relaxed and effortless. Light, playful and romantic, the Chiara Mini is designed for moments that feel carefree yet elevated. WHERE TO WEAR: Summer parties, sunset dinners, rooftop cocktails, vacation nights, birthday celebrations, girls’ nights out, and chic warm-weather events. UNDERWEAR SOLUTION: Seamless underwear or nude-toned underwear. Nipple covers recommended. Stretch Factor: 1/3 Model: 1.73m (5'8\") wearing size XS.",
