      "imageAlt": "Serena",
      "description": "Introducing the ‘ Serena Maxi ’ – a striking fusion of modern structure and fluid elegance. Reimagined in a soft butter yellow hue, this strapless gown brings a fresh, luminous feel to a timeless silhouette. The sculpted bodice is crafted from sleek non-stretch crepe, designed to contour the body and create a beautifully structured shape. The asymmetrical bodice hem adds a contemporary edge, while the lace-up back allows for a cinched, tailored fit that enhances the waist. Flowing from the hips, the chiffon skirt moves effortlessly with every step, creating soft volume and graceful movement. A dramatic thigh-high split introduces a bold, confident touch, balancing sophistication with modern allure. The look is completed with a matching chiffon scarf, adding an elevated, editorial finish to this refined piece. WHERE TO WEAR: Spring events, elegant daytime occasions, sunset dinners, destination weddings, garden parties, formal celebrations, and sophisticated soirées. UNDERWEAR SOLUTION: The bodice provides moderate support. We recommend silicone nipple covers or a strapless bra for a flawless finish. Stretch Factor: 2/3 Dress Length: Approx. 150cm Gentle Dry Clean Only Model: 1.73m (5'8\") wearing size XS",
